# Raw protocol captures — huge, and a whole-bus capture can contain
# keystrokes from other devices on the same bus. Never committed.
# Curated capture *findings* live in docs/captures/ and ARE committed —
# hence the leading slash, which keeps this to the repo root only.
/captures/
*.pcapng
*.usbmon
*.raw

